## 🔎 Technical Verification Matrix (The Stress Test Proof)
Simulated an unapproved deployment breach using an enterprise-grade node size:
```bash
az vm create -g Marathahalli_Lab_RG -n Rogue_VM --image Ubuntu2204 --size Standard_D4s_v3
```
**Defensive Victory:** The incoming command request was blocked at the API gateway by the active policy enforcer, throwing the verified validation log error:
`azure.core.exceptions.HttpResponseError: (InvalidTemplateDeployment) The template deployment failed because of policy violation... Resource 'Rogue_VM' was disallowed by policy 'Enforce_B_Series_Only'.`
